{"t":"LHX","made":"2026-11-12 00:07","name":"L3Harris Technologies, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","employees":45000,"hq":"Melbourne, FL, United States","website":"https://www.l3harris.com","summary_en":"L3Harris Technologies, Inc. provides mission-critical solutions for government and commercial customers worldwide. It operates through three segments: Space & Mission Systems (SMS), Communications & Spectrum Dominance (CSD), and Missile Solutions (MSL). The SMS segment integrates satellite and payload capabilities, including missile warning and defense, with maritime, air special missions, and other global defense and civil government programs. Its MSL segment unites propulsion, hypersonic, and other advanced missile technologies. The CSD segment provides tactical radios, software, waveforms, satellite terminals, and end-to-end battlefield systems for the U.S. Department of Defense, international, federal, and state agency customers; broadband communications; integrated vision solutions, such as helmet-mounted integrated night vision goggles with image intensifier tubes and weapon-mounted sights, aiming lasers, and range finders; and public safety radios and system applications and equipment. The company was formerly known as Harris Corporation and changed its name to L3Harris Technologies, Inc. in June 2019. L3Harris Technologies, Inc. was founded in 1895 and is headquartered in Melbourne, Florida.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"L3Harris Technologies, Inc.는 전 세계 정부 및 기업 고객에게 미션 크리티컬 솔루션을 제공합니다. 우주 및 임무 시스템(SMS), 통신 및 스펙트럼 지배력(CSD), 미사일 솔루션(MSL)의 세 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. SMS 부문은 미사일 경고 및 방어를 포함한 위성 및 페이로드 기능을 해상, 항공 특수 임무, 기타 글로벌 국방 및 민간 정부 프로그램과 통합합니다. MSL 부문은 추진, 극초음속 및 기타 첨단 미사일 기술을 통합합니다. CSD 부문은 미국 국방부, 국제, 연방 및 주 기관 고객을 위한 전술 라디오, 소프트웨어, 파형, 위성 터미널 및 엔드투엔드 전장 시스템을 제공합니다. 광대역 통신; 이미지 강화 튜브와 무기 장착 조준경이 있는 헬멧 장착형 통합 야간 투시경, 조준 레이저 및 거리 측정기와 같은 통합 비전 솔루션; 공공 안전 라디오, 시스템 애플리케이션 및 장비. 이 회사는 이전에 Harris Corporation으로 알려졌으며 2019년 6월에 L3Harris Technologies, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. L3Harris Technologies, Inc.는 1895년에 설립되었으며 플로리다주 멜버른에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":274.9799,"mcap":51201458176.0,"pe":25.603342,"fpe":20.179049,"peg":1.0175,"ps":2.1943796,"pb":2.528946,"ev_ebitda":14.465,"div":1.81,"beta":0.455,"hi52":379.23,"lo52":232.34},"fin":{"rev":23332999168.0,"rev_g":0.071,"eps_g":0.333,"gross":0.25552,"op":0.13252,"net":0.0876,"roe":0.1003,"fcf":3432999936.0,"cash":3020999936.0,"debt":10995999744.0,"de":51.802,"eps":10.74,"feps":13.627},"own":{"short":0.0257,"inst":0.90453005,"insider":0.00453},"analyst":{"n":21,"mean":335.8095,"median":342.0,"high":443.0,"low":241.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.91304,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":11,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":10,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":11,"hold":8,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":11,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"B of A Securities","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":375.0,"priorPriceTarget":325.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-31","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":293.0,"priorPriceTarget":264.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Sector Perform","FromGrade":"Sector Perform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":295.0,"priorPriceTarget":265.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-15","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Sector Perform","FromGrade":"Sector Perform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":265.0,"priorPriceTarget":310.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-14","Firm":"Bernstein","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":318.0,"priorPriceTarget":346.0},{"GradeDate":